      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p class=\"feature\"><em><strong>Shard-Fed.</strong></em></p><p>Hesper works one room from the altar and has done for five hundred years. The heart feeds her across that distance the way a fire warms the next room — steadily, and without ever being asked. Her hands are very sure now. They have had a great deal of practice.</p><p><strong>Proficiency bonus +4</strong> (all attacks, saves she forces, and skills). <strong>Life Drain DC 15.</strong></p>",
